    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "@id": "https://www.gavalier.sk/automatizacia/#faq",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "\u010co sa d\u00e1 automatizova\u0165?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Opakovan\u00e9 \u010dinnosti pod\u013ea jasn\u00fdch pravidiel: prepisovanie \u00fadajov medzi syst\u00e9mami, nahadzovanie produktov, ru\u010dne skladan\u00e9 reporty alebo rozosielanie e-mailov. Ak sa postup v\u017edy riadi t\u00fdmi ist\u00fdmi krokmi, d\u00e1 sa zvy\u010dajne prep\u00edsa\u0165 do skriptu."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Ako zist\u00edm, \u010di sa mi automatiz\u00e1cia oplat\u00ed?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Zavolajte alebo nap\u00ed\u0161te, \u010do rob\u00edte ru\u010dne. Poviem v\u00e1m rovno, \u010di sa to d\u00e1 automatizova\u0165, ako a \u010do to bude st\u00e1\u0165. Hovor aj n\u00e1vrh rie\u0161enia s\u00fa zadarmo a nez\u00e1v\u00e4zn\u00e9."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Ko\u013eko automatiz\u00e1cia stoj\u00ed?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Z\u00e1kazky beriem od p\u00e1r desiatok eur po tis\u00edce, pod\u013ea toho, \u010do treba spravi\u0165. Cenu poviem dopredu a plat\u00ed, dodato\u010dn\u00e9 hodiny pri natiahnutej pr\u00e1ci ne\u00fa\u010dtujem."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "\u010co ak mi v\u00fdsledok nebude sedie\u0165?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Plat\u00edte len za v\u00fdsledok. Ak dodan\u00e9 nesed\u00ed s dohodou, peniaze nep\u00fdtam."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "\u010co ke\u010f sa proces nesk\u00f4r zmen\u00ed?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Odovzdan\u00edm spolupr\u00e1ca nekon\u010d\u00ed. Ke\u010f po \u010dase potrebujete nie\u010do prida\u0165 alebo doladi\u0165, sta\u010d\u00ed zavola\u0165 a nemus\u00edte h\u013eada\u0165 nikoho nov\u00e9ho."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Mus\u00edm rozumie\u0165 programovaniu?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Nie. Sta\u010d\u00ed mi p\u00e1r viet o tom, \u010do rob\u00edte ru\u010dne. Nemus\u00ed to by\u0165 odborn\u00e9, dopt\u00e1m sa na detaily."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Pracujete aj mimo Popradu?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "\u00c1no, pre klientov na celom Slovensku. Z\u00e1kladom je telefon\u00e1t alebo e-mail."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
